  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 149,
      "end": 156,
      "sourceExcerpt": "任取 ε>0。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 156,
      "end": 168,
      "sourceExcerpt": "取 δ=ε/(L+1)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 168,
      "end": 196,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因为 L≥0，所以 L+1>0；由 ε>0 得 δ>0。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 196,
      "end": 216,
      "sourceExcerpt": "任取实数 x,y，假设 |x-y|<δ。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 216,
      "end": 251,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由 Lipschitz 条件有 |f(x)-f(y)|≤L|x-y|。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 251,
      "end": 292,
      "sourceExcerpt": "又因为 |x-y|≥0 且 L≤L+1，得到 L|x-y|≤(L+1)|x-y|。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 292,
      "end": 338,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由于 L+1>0，乘以不等式 |x-y|<δ，得到 (L+1)|x-y|<(L+1)δ=ε。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "index": 7,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 338,
      "end": 361,
      "sourceExcerpt": "合并上述不等式得 |f(x)-f(y)|<ε。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_7",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-8",
      "index": 8,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 361,
      "end": 388,
      "sourceExcerpt": "这里 δ 只依赖 ε 和固定的 L，与 x,y 无关。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_8",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-9",
      "index": 9,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 388,
      "end": 408,
      "sourceExcerpt": "所以 f 在整个实数轴上一致连续。证毕。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_9",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
